Benchmarks/frontier/nvidia-vfx*
Benchmarks/frontier/paired-ladder/nvvfx-*
Tools/experiments/nvidia_teacher_frames.py
Tools/experiments/probe_nvidia_vfx.py
Tools/frontier_eval/evaluate_nvidia_vfx.py
Tools/frontier_eval/evaluate_nvidia_vfx_holdout.py
Tools/experiments/build_teacher_cache.py
